":"https://www.ftc.gov.tw/internet/main/doc/docDetail.aspx?docid=18509&mid=1180&uid=1932","source":"Taiwan Fair Trade Commission","limitations":"No acquisition closing or purchase-price payment is established. An appeal or termination must be separately verified; a minority holding is not automatically legal control."},{"id":"ods-editorial-foodpanda-ai-20260908","date":"2026-09-08","publishedAt":null,"dateBasis":null,"title":"foodpanda adds live discovery to ChatGPT and Claude in Singapore","summary":"foodpanda says its Singapore integrations retrieve current restaurant and meal recommendations. Customers follow links into the app or website to place and pay for orders.","implication":"Test GoFood conversational discovery while retaining control over availability, price and checkout.","nextAction":"Track click-to-order conversion, menu freshness, incremental contribution and recommendation accuracy.","url":"https://www.foodpanda.com/newsroom/foodpanda-brings-food-discovery-to-chatgpt-and-claude-in-singapore/","source":"foodpanda newsroom","limitations":"This is discovery with checkout handoff, not payment inside an AI conversation."},{"id":"capital-uber-deliveryhero-20260716","date":"2026-07-16","publishedAt":null,"dateBasis":null,"title":"Uber offers to acquire Delivery Hero with separate SSW carve-out","summary":"Uber announced a takeover offer and a separate conditional transfer of businesses in 14 markets to SSW Partners.","implication":"Model merger remedies, carve-outs and geographic conflicts before assuming a single global owner.","nextAction":"Acceptance conditions, merger control, financing, carved-out brands and final closing.","url":"https://investor.uber.com/news-events/news/press-release-details/2026/Uber-Announces-Acquisition-Offer-for-Delivery-Hero/default.aspx","source":"Uber Investor Relations","limitations":"Source expected closing in second half of 2027; do not mark completed or assign all Delivery Hero brands to Uber."},{"id":"ods-editorial-food